  - "Reitsma"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for a methodological audit of the Zhou–Dendukuri
  bivariate I² reported by summary.reitsma() in mada 0.5.12. The repository
  contains aggregate 2×2 data, R code for reproducing the native implementation
  and the reconstructed statistic, published reanalyses, and a Monte Carlo
  simulation evaluating the behaviour of the statistic as the number of studies
  increases while population heterogeneity remains fixed.
